{"id":"CH-Instructions","title":"7. 通用 BEAM 指令","html":"<div class=\"sect1\"> <h2 id=\"CH-Instructions\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"CH-Instructions\" href=\"#CH-Instructions\">7. 通用 BEAM 指令</a></h2> <div class=\"sectionbody\"> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Beam 有两套不同的指令集：一套是内部指令集，称为 <em>specific</em>；另一套是外部指令集，称为 <em>generic</em>。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>generic 指令集可以说就是官方指令集，它是编译器和 Beam 解释器共同使用的那套指令。如果存在一份官方的 Erlang 虚拟机规范，那么它规定的就会是这套指令集。如果你想自己写一个面向 Beam 的编译器，就应当以这套指令集为目标；如果你想自己实现一个 EVM，就应当处理这套指令集。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>外部指令集相当稳定，但它确实会随着 Erlang 版本变化，尤其是在大版本之间。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>这正是本章将要介绍的指令集。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>另一套指令集是 specific，它是 Beam 为实现外部指令集而使用的优化指令集。为了让你理解 Beam 的工作方式，我们会在在线附录中介绍这套指令集。内部指令集可能在小版本之间、甚至在补丁版本中毫无预告地发生变化。把任何工具建立在内部指令集之上都是有风险的。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>本章将详细介绍指令的通用语法以及若干指令组；带简要说明的完整指令列表见 <a data-ref=\"AP-Instructions\" href=\"#AP-Instructions\">附录 B</a>。</p> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_instruction_definitions\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_instruction_definitions\" href=\"#_instruction_definitions\">7.1. 指令定义</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>通用指令的名称和操作码定义在 <code>lib/compiler/src/genop.tab</code> 中。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>该文件中包含 Beam 指令格式的版本号，这个版本号也会写入 <code>.beam</code> 文件。到目前为止该编号从未变更，仍是版本 0。如果外部格式发生不向后兼容的变更，这个编号就会被修改。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>文件 genop.tab 被 <code>beam_makeops</code> 用作输入，后者是一个 perl 脚本，负责根据 ops 表生成代码。该生成器既用于为编译器生成 Erlang 代码（beam_opcodes.hrl 和 beam_opcodes.erl），也用于为模拟器生成 C 代码（beam_opcodes.c 和 beam_opcodes.h；对于传统的 BEAM 解释器，还会生成 beam_hot.h、beam_warm.h 和 beam_cold.h；对于 BeamAsm，则生成 beamasm_emit.h 和 beamasm_protos.h）。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>文件中任何以 \"#\" 开头的行都是注释，会被 <code>beam_makeops</code> 忽略。文件中可以包含定义，这些定义在 perl 脚本中会转换成绑定，形式如下：</p> </div> <div class=\"literalblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre>NAME=EXPR</pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>例如：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre>BEAM_FORMAT_NUMBER=0</pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Beam 格式编号与外部 beam 格式中的 <code>instructionset</code> 字段相同。只有当指令集发生不向后兼容的变更时，该编号才会递增。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>该文件的主要内容是操作码定义，形式如下：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre>OPNUM: [-]NAME/ARITY</pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>其中 OPNUM 和 ARITY 是整数，NAME 是以小写字母（a-z）开头的标识符，而 <em>:</em>、<em>-</em> 以及 <em>/</em> 是字面量。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>例如：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre>1: label/1</pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>减号（-）表示该函数已废弃。废弃函数会保留自己的操作码，以便加载器在一定程度上保持向后兼容（加载器能够识别出已废弃的指令，并拒绝加载相应代码）。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在本章的剩余部分，我们将详细讲解一些 BEAM 指令。带简要说明的完整列表参见：<a data-ref=\"AP-Instructions\" href=\"#AP-Instructions\">附录 B</a>。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_beam_code_listings\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_beam_code_listings\" href=\"#_beam_code_listings\">7.2. BEAM 代码清单</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>正如 <a data-ref=\"CH-Compiler\" href=\"#CH-Compiler\">第 2 章</a> 所述，我们可以给 Erlang 编译器传入选项 'S'，从而得到一个 <code>.S</code> 文件，其中以人和机器都可读的格式（实际上是 Erlang 项）给出该模块的 BEAM 代码。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>设有文件 beamexample1.erl：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"ni\">module</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">beamexample1</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"ni\">export</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]).</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">id</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">I</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">when</span> <span class=\"nb\">is_integer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">I</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nv\">I</span><span class=\"p\">.</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>用 <code>erlc -S beamexample1.erl</code> 编译后，我们得到如下的 beamexmaple1.S 文件：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">module</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">beamexample1</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>  <span class=\"c\">%% version = 0\n</span>\n<span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">exports</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">[{</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">module_info</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">module_info</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">attributes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">[]}.</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"p\">,[{</span><span class=\"n\">location</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s\">\"beamexample1.erl\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">func_info</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">beamexample1</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">is_integer</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},[{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">module_info</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"p\">,[]}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">func_info</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">beamexample1</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">module_info</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">move</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">beamexample1</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"p\">,[]}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">call_ext_only</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">extfunc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">erlang</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">get_module_info</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">module_info</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"p\">,[]}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">func_info</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">beamexample1</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">module_info</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">move</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">move</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">beamexample1</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"p\">,[]}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">call_ext_only</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">extfunc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">erlang</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">get_module_info</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>除了整数恒等函数实际的 beam 代码之外，我们还得到了一些元指令。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>第一行 <code>{module, beamexample1}. %% version = 0</code> 告诉我们模块名 <code>beamexample1</code> 以及指令集的版本号 <code>0</code>。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>接下来是一个导出函数列表 <code>id/1</code>、<code>module_info/0</code>、<code>module_info/1</code>。可以看到，编译器已经向代码中添加了两个自动生成的函数。这两个函数只是转发到通用 module info BIF（<code>erlang:get_module_info/1</code> 和 <code>erlang:get_module_info/2</code>）的派发器，只是把模块名作为第一个参数附加了进去。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>{attributes, []}</code> 这一行列出了所有已定义的编译器属性，本例中没有任何属性。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>随后我们得知该模块中的标签少于 7 个，即 <code>{labels, 7}</code>，这使得代码加载可以一趟完成。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>最后一类元指令是 <code>function</code> 指令，其格式为 <code>{function, Name, Arity, StartLabel}</code>。从 <code>id</code> 函数可以看出，起始标签实际上是该函数代码中的第二个标签。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>{label, N}</code> 并不是一条真正的指令，它在加载时不占用任何内存空间。它只是为代码中的某个位置取一个局部名称（或编号）。每个标签都可能标记一个基本块的开头，因为它是跳转的潜在目标。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>第一个标签（<code>{label,1}</code>）之后的前两条指令实际上是生成错误的代码，它们会附带行号以及模块、函数和元数信息，并抛出异常。这两条指令就是 <code>line</code> 和 <code>func_info</code>。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>函数的主体在 <code>{label,2}</code> 之后，即指令 <code>{test,is_integer,{f,1},[{x,0}]}</code>。test 指令会检查它的参数（位于末尾的列表中，此处即变量 <code>{x,0}</code>）是否满足测试条件，在本例中就是判断它是否为整数（<code>is_integer</code>）。如果测试通过，就执行下一条指令（<code>return</code>）；否则函数会失败并跳转到标签 1（<code>{f,1}</code>），也就是说，执行在标签 1 处继续，在那里抛出函数子句异常。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>该文件中的另外两个函数是自动生成的。观察第二个函数，指令 <code>{move,{x,0},{x,1}}</code> 把寄存器 <code>x0</code> 中的参数移动到第二个参数寄存器 <code>x1</code>。接着指令 <code>{move,{atom,beamexample1},{x,0}}</code> 把模块名原子移动到第一个参数寄存器 <code>x0</code>。最后对 <code>erlang:get_module_info/2</code>（<code>{call_ext_only,2,{extfunc,erlang,get_module_info,2}}</code>）发起尾调用。正如我们将在下一节看到的，调用指令有若干种不同的形式。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_calls\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_calls\" href=\"#_calls\">7.3. 调用</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>正如我们将在 <a data-ref=\"CH-Calls\" href=\"#CH-Calls\">第 8 章</a> 看到的，Erlang 中的调用有若干种不同的类型。为了在指令集中区分本地调用和远程调用，远程调用的指令名中含有 <code>_ext</code>。本地调用只带一个模块代码中的标签，而远程调用则接受形如 <code>{extfunc, Module, Function, Arity}</code> 的目标。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>为了区分普通调用（会构建栈）和尾递归调用，后者的名称中含有 <code>_only</code> 或 <code>_last</code>。带 <code>_last</code> 的那种变体还会按其最后一个参数指定的数量释放相应数量的栈槽。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>还有一条 <code>call_fun Arity</code> 指令，用于调用存放在寄存器 <code>{x, Arity}</code> 中的闭包。参数存放在 <code>x0</code> 到 <code>{x, Arity-1}</code> 中。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>所有类型调用指令的完整列表参见 <a data-ref=\"AP-Instructions\" href=\"#AP-Instructions\">附录 B</a>。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_stack_and_heap_management\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_stack_and_heap_management\" href=\"#_stack_and_heap_management\">7.4. 栈（与堆）管理</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在 Beam 上，Erlang 进程的栈与堆共享同一块内存区域，完整的讨论参见 <a data-ref=\"CH-Processes\" href=\"#CH-Processes\">第 3 章</a> 和 <a data-ref=\"CH-Memory\" href=\"#CH-Memory\">第 11 章</a>。栈向低地址方向增长，堆向高地址方向增长。如果栈或堆上需要的空间超过可用空间，Beam 就会执行一次垃圾回收。</p> </div> <div class=\"sidebarblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <div class=\"dlist\"> <dl> <dt class=\"hdlist1\"><strong>叶子函数</strong></dt> <dd> <p>叶子函数是指不调用任何其他函数的函数。</p> </dd> <dt class=\"hdlist1\"><strong>非叶子函数</strong></dt> <dd> <p>非叶子函数是指可能会调用其他函数的函数。</p> </dd> </dl> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>进入非叶子函数时，<em>延续指针</em>（continuation pointer，CP）会被保存在栈上，退出时再从栈上读回。这一工作由 <code>allocate</code> 和 <code>deallocate</code> 指令完成，它们用于为当前指令建立和拆除栈帧。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>叶子函数的函数骨架如下所示：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Arity</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">StartLabel</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">L1</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">func_info</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">Module</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">Name</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"nv\">Arity</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">L2</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">...</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"p\">.</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>非叶子函数的函数骨架如下所示：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Arity</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">StartLabel</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">L1</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">func_info</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">Module</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">atom</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">Name</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"nv\">Arity</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">L2</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">allocate</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">Need</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">Live</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n\n    <span class=\"p\">...</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">call</span> <span class=\"p\">...</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">...</span>\n\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">deallocate</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nv\">Need</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"p\">.</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>allocate StackNeed Live</code> 指令会保存延续指针（CP），并在栈上为 <code>StackNeed</code> 个额外字分配空间。如果分配过程中需要 GC，则保存 <code>Live</code> 个 X 寄存器。例如，若 <code>Live</code> 为 2，则寄存器 <code>x0</code> 和 <code>x1</code> 会被保存。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在栈上分配空间时，栈指针（E）会减小。</p> </div> <div class=\"imageblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <img alt=\"Diagram\" height=\"168\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"bbimg:diag-ditaa-md5-ed26d9c6608593ca5cd641598288a41f.png\" width=\"560\"/> </div> <div class=\"title\">图 24. Allocate 1 0</div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>所有类型的分配（allocate）与释放（deallocate）指令的完整列表参见 <a data-ref=\"AP-Instructions\" href=\"#AP-Instructions\">附录 B</a>。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_message_passing\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_message_passing\" href=\"#_message_passing\">7.5. 消息传递</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在 beam 代码中发送消息非常直接，只要使用 <code>send</code> 指令即可。不过要注意，send 指令不接收任何参数，它更像一次函数调用：它假定参数（目标进程和消息）已经在参数寄存器 <code>x0</code> 和 <code>x1</code> 中。消息还会从 <code>x1</code> 复制到 <code>x0</code>。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>接收消息要稍微复杂一些，因为它既涉及带模式匹配的选择性接收，又会在函数体内部引入一个让出/恢复点。（还有一个特殊特性可以利用 ref 尽量减少消息队列扫描，稍后会详细说明。）</p> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_a_minimal_receive_loop\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_a_minimal_receive_loop\" href=\"#_a_minimal_receive_loop\">7.5.1. 最小化的接收循环</a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>一个接收任意消息且没有超时的最简接收循环（例如 <code>receive _ -&gt; ok end</code>）在 BEAM 代码中如下所示：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\">  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">loop_rec</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">remove_message</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">jump</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">wait</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n     <span class=\"p\">...</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>loop_rec L2 x0</code> 指令首先检查消息队列中是否有消息。如果没有任何消息，执行会跳转到 L2，进程将在那里被挂起，等待消息到达。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果消息队列中有消息，<code>loop_rec</code> 指令还会把该消息从 <em>m-buf</em> 移动到进程堆。m-buf 处理的细节参见 <a data-ref=\"CH-Memory\" href=\"#CH-Memory\">第 11 章</a> 和 <a data-ref=\"CH-Processes\" href=\"#CH-Processes\">第 3 章</a>。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>对于像 <code>receive _ -&gt; ok end</code> 这样接收任意消息的代码，不需要做模式匹配，我们只需执行一次 <code>remove_message</code>，把下一条消息从消息队列中解链下来。（它还会移除任何超时，稍后详细说明。）</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_a_selective_receive_loop\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_a_selective_receive_loop\" href=\"#_a_selective_receive_loop\">7.5.2. 选择性接收循环</a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>对于像 <code>receive [] -&gt; ok end</code> 这样的选择性接收，我们会遍历消息队列，检查队列中是否有消息匹配。</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\">  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">loop_rec</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">is_nil</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">},[{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">remove_message</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">jump</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">loop_rec_end</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">wait</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">...</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在本例中，如果信箱里有消息，我们会在 loop_rec 指令之后对 Nil 做一次模式匹配。如果消息不匹配，我们最终会到达 L2，在那里指令 <code>loop_rec_end</code> 会把保存指针推进到下一条消息（<code>p-&gt;msg.save = &amp;(*p-&gt;msg.save)-&gt;next</code>），然后跳回 L1。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果消息队列中已没有更多消息，进程会在 L3 处被 <code>wait</code> 指令挂起，此时保存指针指向消息队列的末尾。当该进程被重新调度时，它只会查看消息队列中保存点之后的新消息。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"_a_receive_loop_with_a_timeout\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_a_receive_loop_with_a_timeout\" href=\"#_a_receive_loop_with_a_timeout\">7.5.3. 带超时的接收循环</a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果我们为选择性接收加上超时，wait 指令就会被替换为一条 wait_timeout 指令，其后跟着一条 timeout 指令以及超时之后要执行的代码。</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\">  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">loop_rec</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">is_nil</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">},[{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">remove_message</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">jump</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">loop_rec_end</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">wait_timeout</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">integer</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">...</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>wait_timeout</code> 指令会按给定的时间（本例中为 1000 ms）设置一个超时定时器，它还会把下一条指令（即 <code>timeout</code>）的地址保存到 <code>p-&gt;def_arg_reg[0]</code> 中，随后在设置定时器时，把 <code>p-&gt;i</code> 设置为指向 <code>def_arg_reg</code>。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>这意味着，如果进程挂起期间没有匹配的消息到达，1 秒之后就会触发超时，该进程的执行将在 timeout 指令处继续。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>注意，如果信箱中到达了一条不匹配的消息，进程会被调度执行，并运行接收循环中的模式匹配代码，但超时不会被取消。要由 <code>remove_message</code> 代码来一并移除超时定时器。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>timeout</code> 指令会把信箱的保存点重置为队列中的第一个元素，并清除 PCB 中的超时标志（F_TIMO）。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect3\"> <h4 id=\"Ref-Trick\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"Ref-Trick\" href=\"#Ref-Trick\">7.5.4. 同步调用技巧（又称 Ref 技巧）</a></h4> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>现在我们来看看接收循环的最后一种版本，其中使用前面提到的 ref 技巧来避免长时间的信箱扫描。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Erlang 代码中一种常见的模式是：在两个进程之间用 send 和 receive 实现某种 \"远程调用\"。gen_server 就使用了这种模式。这类代码通常被隐藏在由普通函数调用构成的库之后。例如，你调用函数 <code>counter:increment(Counter)</code>，而在背后它会变成类似 <code>Counter ! {self(), inc}, receive {Counter, Count} -&gt; Count end</code> 的东西。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>这通常是封装进程状态的一种很好的抽象。不过，当调用进程的信箱中已经堆积了许多消息时，就会有一点小问题。在这种情况下，receive 不得不检查信箱中的每一条消息，最后才发现除最后一条之外没有任何消息与返回消息匹配。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果你的服务器接收大量消息，并且对每条消息都要发起若干次这样的远程调用，这种情况就相当常见；如果没有施加反向节流，服务器的消息队列就会被填满。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>为了解决这个问题，ERTS 中有一个 hack：识别出这种模式，从而避免为寻找返回消息而扫描整个消息队列。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>编译器会识别在 receive 中使用新创建的引用（ref）的代码，并生成相应的代码来避免长时间的信箱扫描，因为这个新的 ref 不可能已经在信箱里。</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\">  <span class=\"nv\">Ref</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nf\">make_ref</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n  <span class=\"nv\">Counter</span> <span class=\"o\">!</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"nf\">self</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">inc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Ref</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n  <span class=\"k\">receive</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"nv\">Ref</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">Count</span><span class=\"p\">}</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nv\">Count</span>\n  <span class=\"k\">end</span><span class=\"p\">.</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>这样就得到了一个完整 receive 的骨架，如下所示。</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\">    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">recv_mark</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">call_ext</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">extfunc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">erlang</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">make_ref</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">...</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">send</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">recv_set</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">loop_rec</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">is_tuple</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">},[{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">...</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">is_eq_exact</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">},[{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">},{</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}]}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">...</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">remove_message</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">...</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">jump</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">loop_rec_end</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">wait</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}}.</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">}.</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>recv_mark</code> 指令会把当前位置（即末尾 <code>msg.last</code>）保存到 <code>msg.saved_last</code> 中，并把标签的地址保存到 <code>msg.mark</code> 中。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p><code>recv_set</code> 指令会检查 <code>msg.mark</code> 是否指向下一条指令，如果是，就把保存点（<code>msg.save</code>）移动到创建该 ref 之前收到的最后一条消息（<code>msg.saved_last</code>）。如果标记无效（即不等于 <code>msg.save</code>），该指令什么都不做。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"}